==============================================================================
LIMITATIONS (declared)
==============================================================================
 - SSA GNI per capita available only for 2011-2015 (n=5); NO imputation.
 - Pooled regressions are UNBALANCED (LMC 1975-2015 vs SSA 2011-2015); the
   interaction may partly reflect time-period composition, not only group.
 - 2 aggregate units only; results are associational, NOT causal.
 - LMC used as proxy for 'developing countries' (assumption).
 - Series is GNI per capita constant 2015 US$ (proxy for per-capita GDP).
 - HAC SEs with very small n; low statistical power.
 - 'Adjusted savings: education expenditure' differs slightly from
   'public education spending % of total expenditure'.